name annotate-equations
category Package
revision 62932
shortdesc Easily annotate math equations using TikZ
longdesc This package provides commands that make it easy to highlight
longdesc terms in equations and add annotation labels using TikZ. It
longdesc should work with pdfLaTeX as well as LuaLaTeX.
